---
import {groups,workflowTopics,guideHref} from '../../data/workflow-en';
import {caseCatalog} from '../../data/workflow-en/catalog';
import {gmailGuideUrl} from '../../data/workflow-en/gmail';
import CaseDirectory from './CaseDirectory.astro';
interface Props {group?:string}
const {group}=Astro.props;
const meta=group?groups[group]:undefined;
const choices=caseCatalog.filter(item=>!group||item.group===group);
const featured=group==='office'?caseCatalog[0]:choices.find(item=>workflowTopics.some(topic=>guideHref(topic)===item.href));
const promptCount=choices.reduce((n,item)=>n+item.prompts,0);
const fileCount=choices.reduce((n,item)=>n+item.files,0);
---
<div id="main" class="wf-shell wt-hub">
 {meta?<>
  <nav class="wf-breadcrumb" data-pagefind-ignore aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/en/recipes/topics/">All topics</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>{meta.title}</span></nav>
  <section class="wf-topic-hero" aria-labelledby="topic-title"><div><div class="wf-kicker">WORKFLOWS / TOPIC {meta.number}</div><p class="wf-eyebrow">Choose a real task, then follow the evidence</p><h1 id="topic-title">{meta.title}</h1><p class="wf-lead">{meta.summary}</p><div class="wf-actions"><a class="wf-button" href={featured?.href}>Start the featured tutorial ↗</a><a class="wf-text-link" href="#all-cases">Choose your scenario ↓</a></div><div class="wf-byline">Prepared by shancha <span>·</span> {choices.length} complete tutorials <span>·</span> {promptCount} prompts <span>·</span> {fileCount} files</div></div><aside class="wt-hub-method"><span>Every tutorial follows the same method</span><ol><li><b>01</b><div><strong>Inspect complete inputs</strong><p>Download source files and agree the scope.</p></div></li><li><b>02</b><div><strong>Work in stages</strong><p>Use prompts with explicit deliverables.</p></div></li><li><b>03</b><div><strong>Compare the evidence</strong><p>Check each result and missing item.</p></div></li><li><b>04</b><div><strong>Validate before reuse</strong><p>Try your own small batch before scheduling.</p></div></li></ol></aside></section>
  {featured&&<section class="wf-feature" aria-labelledby="featured-title"><div class="wf-feature-main"><div class="wf-kicker">FEATURED / COMPLETE TUTORIAL</div><h2 id="featured-title">{featured.title}</h2><p>{featured.lead}</p><ul class="wf-feature-list"><li>Complete input, item-by-item outputs and a reference report</li><li>{featured.stages} stages with prompts and acceptance checks</li><li>{featured.files} downloadable practice files</li></ul><a class="wf-button" href={featured.href}>Open the complete tutorial →</a></div><div class="wf-feature-result"><div class="wf-result-bar"><strong>What you will keep</strong><span>Synthetic practice</span></div>{[['Original materials','Source identities and complete input for independent practice.','INPUT'],['Reviewable deliverables','Results, source evidence and exceptions you can inspect.','RESULT'],['Reusable method','Staged prompts, troubleshooting and acceptance checks.','SKILL']].map(([title,text,format],i)=><div class="wf-deliverable"><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></div><b>{format}</b></div>)}<p class="wf-result-note">Live connections, writes and scheduling require separate validation. Each tutorial states its exact scope.</p></div></section>}
 </>:<>
  <header class="wt-hub-hero"><div><div class="wf-kicker">WORKFLOWS / CASE LIBRARY</div><p class="wf-eyebrow">Choose the work you want to complete</p><h1>25 complete tutorials.<br/>Practice every step.</h1><p class="wf-lead">Every case includes preparation, staged prompts, complete examples, troubleshooting, acceptance checks and downloads. Start with one small workflow and compare its evidence.</p><div class="wf-byline">Prepared by shancha <span>·</span> {choices.length} tutorials <span>·</span> {promptCount} prompts <span>·</span> {fileCount} files</div><div class="wf-actions"><a class="wf-button" href="#all-cases">Browse all tutorials ↓</a><a class="wf-text-link" href={gmailGuideUrl}>Start with Gmail →</a></div></div><aside class="wt-hub-method"><span>From a sample to a reusable method</span><ol><li><b>01</b><div><strong>Read the input</strong><p>Agree what the task covers.</p></div></li><li><b>02</b><div><strong>Follow the stages</strong><p>Copy prompts and inspect outputs.</p></div></li><li><b>03</b><div><strong>Check the reference</strong><p>Trace facts and exceptions.</p></div></li><li><b>04</b><div><strong>Try your own batch</strong><p>Validate before recurring runs.</p></div></li></ol></aside></header>
  <section aria-labelledby="topics-title"><div class="wf-section-heading"><div><div class="wf-kicker">START WITH YOUR TASK</div><h2 id="topics-title">Choose a topic</h2></div><p>Five work areas.<br/>A complete tutorial for every case.</p></div><div class="wt-topic-list">{Object.entries(groups).map(([id,topic])=>{const entries=caseCatalog.filter(item=>item.group===id);const first=id==='office'?entries[0]:entries.find(item=>workflowTopics.some(guide=>guideHref(guide)===item.href))!;return<article class="wt-topic-card"><span class="wt-topic-number">{topic.number}</span><div class="wt-topic-main"><p class="wf-eyebrow">{entries.length} complete tutorials</p><h3><a href={`/en/recipes/topics/${id}/`}>{topic.title} ↗</a></h3><p>{topic.summary}</p><div class="wt-topic-tags">{entries.slice(0,3).map(item=><span>{item.tools.split(' · ')[0]}</span>)}</div></div><div class="wt-topic-guide"><span>A good place to start</span><a href={first.href}>{first.title} <b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a><small>{first.stages} stages · {first.prompts} prompts · {first.files} files</small></div></article>})}</div></section>
 </>}
 <CaseDirectory group={group}/>
 <div class="wf-reading-note"><strong>About these tutorials</strong><p>shancha prepared the tutorials, prompts and practice files. Each page identifies synthetic examples, historical real tests and unverified live-account operations separately. Practice success does not establish real connection, write or scheduled-run success.</p></div>
 {meta&&<div class="wt-next"><a class="wf-text-link" href="/en/recipes/topics/">← Back to all five topics</a><a class="wf-text-link" href={featured?.href}>Start the featured tutorial →</a></div>}
</div>
